===Notes===
Scout Charisa v2 and giants will despawn after 15 minutes. Giants will not despawn while aggro, however. It's possible to kill [[a Kromzek Captain]] after Scout Charisa v2 despawns, or for her to despawn before you give her the [[Broken Disk]]. If this happens, then save the disk for a later scout roll. Give the disk to Scout Charisa v2 (holding bag) <b>ONLY</b>. This will not interfere with other players. Scout Charisa v2 will accept quest items (Disk, Robe, Bracer) from any factioned player during her 15 minute window.
'''''See also: [[Scout Charisa/Player Agreement]]'''''


